  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## New Apps\n* Bump `net_conduit_tcp` from `1.2.3` to `1.2.4`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_tcp/1.2.3...net_conduit_tcp/1.2.4)\n* Bump `net_conduit_websocket` from `1.2.3` to `1.2.4`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_websocket/1.2.3...net_conduit_websocket/1.2.4)\n* Bump `net_conduit_udp` from `1.2.3` to `1.2.4`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_udp/1.2.3...net_conduit_udp/1.2.4)\n* Bump `net_conduit_ipc` from `1.2.3` to `1.2.4`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_ipc/1.2.3...net_conduit_ipc/1.2.4)\n* Bump `net_conduit_quic` from `1.2.3` to `1.2.4`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_quic/1.2.3...net_conduit_quic/1.2.4)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Bump Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk from 17.14.0 to 18.0.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/25\n* Improve thread-safety and atomicity in writes by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/27\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/build.20251206034857.affbbed...build.20251206223524.68b86b8",
